ishes","level":"B2","prompt":"Use a past form for an unreal present wish: “I wish she ____ the travel leaflet more often.”","choices":[{"id":"A","text":"to translate"},{"id":"B","text":"translated"},{"id":"C","text":"translates"},{"id":"D","text":"translating"}],"answerId":"B","hint":"This is an **unreal present wish**; past form marks distance from reality.","explanation":"The wish imagines a different present habit, so it uses past-form **translated**.","keywords":["present-wish"],"skill":"present-wish","contextKey":"wishes-4","fingerprint":"d5fb41e5bcaa80fd653686f0c5045213f7736547f95fd75664ccdb230d425e41","source":"seed","provenance":{"kind":"original-guidance-aligned","referenceIds":["bc-wishes"],"version":"core-2026-09-v3","reviewStatus":"automated-checked; educator-review-pending"},"teaching":{"steps":["This is an **unreal present wish**; past form marks distance from reality.","The wish imagines a different present habit, so it uses past-form **translated**.","Choose **translated**. Read the complete sentence again and check both its form and its intended meaning."],"choiceReasons":{"A":"A to-infinitive does not supply the finite predicate after she.","B":"The wish imagines a different present habit, so it uses past-form **translated**.","C":"The ordinary unreal-present wish uses a past form rather than present -s.","D":"An -ing form alone cannot complete the finite clause."}}},{"id":"1e4d1e61-8818-59d0-acb0-25b06ff38211","topicSlug":"wishes","level":"B2","prompt":"The task was not done yesterday: “I wish I ____ the travel leaflet then.”","choices":[{"id":"A","text":"would translate"},{"id":"B","text":"had translated"},{"id":"C","text":"have translated"},{"id":"D","text":"had translating"}],"answerId":"B","hint":"The time **then** refers to a finished past; use **past perfect** for the regret.","explanation":"A regret about yesterday uses **had + translated** after wish.","keywords":["past-regret"],"skill":"past-regret","contextKey":"wishes-4","fingerprint":"